          "scope": "Private combined engine over original m5-copy containing exactly P07 ordered ten-expert reduction, W02 exact helper top10 selector with original tie/exception/subnormal fallback, and P11 V1 compact expert/token tiles. Existing independent GGML_M5_LAB_REDUCE10, GGML_M5_LAB_TOP10 and GGML_M5_LAB_COMPACT_TILES flags allow individual and combined profiles. No V2 column-first grid, P10 route reuse, QSA, draft-cap, graph/math/cache/precision/default changes beyond the three inherited mechanisms. Original selector marker/status and compact marker/counter retained; stack-only reduce10 once marker and private encoding counter occur after dispatch. TOP_K and MM_ID retain separate allocator-accounted scratch; reduction consumes normal projection output with original fusion and overlap checks.",
